    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13280" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dē-questus</span></b> , a, um,
			Part. [queror], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>having deeply deplored, bitterly complained
