				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">secum dequesta labores,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 5, 448</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">imbres,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 1, 404</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">talia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 11, 627</span></i>
			.</div>
